1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:04,740
Delhi mein pollution itna badh gaya ki government ko GRAP-1 lagana pada.

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:11,420
Lekin 29–30 October ki barish ke baad AQI 229 se seedha 111 pe aa gaya.

3
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,780
Kyun? Chalo batata hoon.

4
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:15,730
Asal mein har boond ek chhota vacuum cleaner hai.

5
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:19,600
Delhi ki hawa mein dhool aur dhuein ke bahut chhote kan hote hain.

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:24,070
Yeh itne halke hote hain ki neeche girte hi nahi, hawa mein tairte rehte hain,

7
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:26,340
aur seedha hamari saans mein jaate hain.

8
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:30,340
Jab barish hoti hai, toh girti hui boond in kanon se takrati hai,

9
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:33,490
unhe apne saath chipka leti hai, aur zameen pe le aati hai.

10
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:36,690
Upar se geeli sadak se dhool udna bhi band ho jaata hai.

11
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:40,130
Par ek baat: halki boonda-baandi se utna fark nahi padta.

12
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:43,670
Achhi, tez barish ho, tabhi hawa sach mein saaf hoti hai.

13
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:49,110
Matlab barish hawa ko dho deti hai, isliye barish ke baad aasmaan neela dikhta hai.

14
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:53,550
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo!
